@startuml
skinparam defaultFontName "Noto Sans CJK SC"
skinparam shadowing false
hide footbox

participant "Voime" as Voime
participant "arboard / 系统剪贴板" as Clip
participant "Hyprland" as Compositor
participant "XWayland" as Xwayland
participant "目标应用" as App

Voime -> Clip : Clipboard::new()
Voime -> Clip : set_text(单条 Final)
Voime -> Compositor : VK 发送 Ctrl+V / Ctrl+Shift+V
Compositor -> App : 粘贴按键
alt VK 粘贴失败且目标为 XWayland
  Voime -> Xwayland : XTEST Ctrl+V
  Xwayland -> App : 粘贴按键
end
App -> Clip : 读取剪贴板
App -> App : 在光标处插入文本
@enduml
